{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^What are you doing? Meow. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Waiting for my treats. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^They come from above. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^From above? ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Yes. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^They’re from my 'God'. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Delicious treats. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Clams, oysters, shells...hmmm. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^From your ‘god’? ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Yes, the people up there above.","\n","^Meow, I don’t think those are gods.. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^But they send me things, they’re kind to me ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^I don’t even think they know I exist. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^But here I am, receiving their gifts. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Has god never been generous to you? ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^No. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^I have to eat scraps from the bins behind the shop. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^There is this girl ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^she feeds me nice things. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^She’s the only one who is kind to me... ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^but she’s not a god. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Whatever. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^I’m waiting for today’s gift. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Any moment now. Ooo it’s going to be good. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}